        <p>South City 1 and 2 and Sushant Lok are largely plotted colonies. Many plots have been rebuilt as builder floors, while others are still independent houses. In a typical builder floor, each floor has its own rooftop tank and all of them are fed from one shared underground sump. Walk onto one of these roofs and you may find three or four plastic tanks side by side, each with its own owner and its own cleaning history.</p>
